90" end="00:46.540">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.050" end="00:55.180"><span begin="00:47.050" end="00:50.650">I </span><span begin="00:50.650" end="00:51.490">close </span><span begin="00:51.490" end="00:51.910">my </span><span begin="00:51.910" end="00:52.780">eyes </span><span begin="00:52.780" end="00:53.020">and </span><span begin="00:53.020" end="00:54.010">drift </span><span begin="00:54.010" end="00:55.180">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.450" end="01:01.480"><span begin="00:55.450" end="00:56.440">Over </span><span begin="00:56.440" end="00:56.620">the </span><span begin="00:56.620" end="00:57.610">fear </span><span begin="00:57.610" end="00:58.090">that </span><span begin="00:58.090" end="00:58.570">I </span><span begin="00:58.570" end="00:59.170">will </span><span begin="00:59.170" end="01:00.370">never </span><span begin="01:00.370" end="01:01.480">find</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.480" end="01:06.010"><span begin="01:01.480" end="01:01.570">A </span><span begin="01:01.570" end="01:02.620">way </span><span begin="01:02.620" end="01:02.950">to </span><span begin="01:02.950" end="01:03.430">heal </span><span begin="01:03.430" end="01:04.090">my </span><span begin="01:04.090" end="01:06.010">soul</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.070" end="01:12.520"><span begin="01:06.070" end="01:06.760">And </span><span begin="01:06.760" end="01:07.480">I </span><span begin="01:07.480" end="01:08.380">will </span><span begin="01:08.380" end="01:09.100">endure </span><span begin="01:09.100" end="01:10.090">till </span><span begin="01:10.090" end="01:10.450">the </span><span begin="01:10.450" end="01:11.410">end </span><span begin="01:11.410" end="01:11.560">of </span><span begin="01:11.560" end="01:12.520">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.850" end="01:17.410"><span begin="01:12.850" end="01:13.930">Torn </span><span begin="01:13.930" end="01:15.220">away </span><span begin="01:15.220" end="01:15.880">from </spa